# Zoetic Glyph: "When this Aura is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, discover 3." (CR 603.6c, 701.57a.) Bot1 enchants its Mox Ruby, a 5/4 Golem. On turn 2 Bot2 exiles
# the Mox with Swords to Plowshares (Bot1 gains 5 life): the Aura, enchanting nothing, goes to the graveyard as a state-based action and Bot1 discovers 3. The Mountain (a land)
# and Panharmonicon (mana value 4, over 3) go to the bottom of the library; Corsair Captain (mana value 3, inclusive) is cast for free and its enters trigger makes a Treasure.

